Content-Type: application/json

{"usuario": "juanpineda", "contrasena": "clave123"}

### Registro con datos inválidos
POST http://localhost:8080/fixhome-api/api/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{"usuario": "ab", "contrasena": "123"}

### Login correcto
POST http://localhost:8080/fixhome-api/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"usuario": "juanpineda", "contrasena": "clave123"}

